        "objective": "Implement TASK-0093 acceptance criteria in\nsrc/ahra/alignment_session.py and any needed helpers already granted\nfor this task. 1) draft_request runs the Acceptance Agent first,\nreading only the frozen boundary contract; every Claim criterionRefs\nentry must reference a boundary entry ID; capture the ClaimGraph\nsha256 digest in the session snapshot before the Requirement Agent\nis invoked. 2) The Requirement Agent payload includes the boundary\ncontract and the frozen ClaimGraph as read-only input; the accepted\nRequestDraft ClaimGraph must be byte-identical to the frozen digest,\nand any divergence rejects the draft as untrusted input. This guard\nmust detect present falsey values such as an empty claimGraph mapping\ninstead of treating them as absent. 3) A PlanDraft node claimRef that\ndoes not resolve to a claim ID in the frozen ClaimGraph rejects the\ndraft with a structured error naming the unresolved refs. Cover all\nthree behaviors with tests in tests/test_alignment_session.py,\nincluding the falsey-present claimGraph divergence case from\nloop-001 review. Preserve the loop-002 fix if it is still correct.\nThe Workflow B Task reviewer contract requires ReviewResult.criteria\nto include an item whose criterion field is exactly CLM-TASK-0093;\nthe reviewer may add supplemental criteria, but must not omit that\nexact criterion. Run uv run python -B scripts/check.py and record it\nin WorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
